93
00:04:53,700 --> 00:04:55,800
<i>Stop calling me "child,"
you're old.</i>

94
00:04:55,933 --> 00:04:58,567
<i>Because of you,
my life was ruined.</i>

95
00:05:06,033 --> 00:05:09,633
