00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,100
<i>Your condition
is only getting worse.</i>

256
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:55,033
<i> [ISABELLA SNIFFLES]</i>

257
00:16:57,300 --> 00:16:59,367
<i> It's been five years...</i>

258
00:17:01,033 --> 00:17:04,167
<i>searching for our child, Enrico.</i>

259
00:17:07,867 --> 00:17:10,700
<i>We still haven't found
Celestine.</i>

260
00:17:17,633 --> 00:17:19,500
<i> [ISABELLA SNIFFLES]</i>

261
00:17:23,733 --> 00:17:24,667
<i> Isabel?</i>

262
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:26,767
<i> Isabel?</i>

263
00:17:27,933 --> 00:17:28,900
<i> Isabel.</i>

264
00:17:31,567 --> 00:17:33,500
<i>When Ma'am Isabella
passed away...</i>

265
00:17:33,633 --> 00:17:34,767
<i> Isabel.</i>

266
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:37,800
<i>this mansion lost all its color.</i>

267
00:17:44,767 --> 00:17:46,867
[ENRICO SOBS]

268
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:52,600
[ENRICO PLAYING "I'LL BE THERE"
ON PIANO]

269
00:17:54,833 --> 00:17:59,533
<i>But Sir Enrico still plays the
song he wrote for Celestine.</i>

270
00:17:59,667 --> 00:18:02,467
<i>He hopes the missing princess
will hear it</i>

271
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:04,433
<i> and come back to us.</i>

272
00:18:10,467 --> 00:18:12,033
<i> Love.</i>

273
00:18:12,167 --> 00:18:13,233
<i> Are you okay?</i>

274
00:18:17,133 --> 00:18:18,167
<i> Yeah.</i>

275
00:18:19,233 --> 00:18:21,400
<i> Come on, let's eat.</i>

276
00:18:21,567 --> 00:18:23,100
<i> Okay, I'll follow.</i>

277
00:18:34,933 --> 00:18:37,067
<i> But a lot has changed.</i>

278
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,533
<i> Four years ago,</i>

279
00:18:38,667 --> 00:18:41,667
<i>Miss Serina arrived
at the mansion.</i>

280
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:44,567
<i>Sir Enrico fell in love
with her and married her.</i>

281
00:18:45,733 --> 00:18:47,000
<i> But you know,</i>

282
00:18:47,133 --> 00:18:48,833
<i> now that they're married,</i>

283
00:18:48,967 --> 00:18:52,367
<i>her true,
terrible nature has come out.</i>

284
00:19:00,133 --> 00:19:03,867
I really hope Celestine
is still alive.

285
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:05,500
And I hope

286
00:19:05,733 --> 00:19:07,567
she can return here someday.

287
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:10,000
I hope

288
00:19:10,133 --> 00:19:12,233
your words come true.

289
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:24,100
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

290
00:19:25,733 --> 00:19:27,767
Here, let me help you, Angel.

291
00:19:50,433 --> 00:19:51,633
Are you happy now?

292
00:19:57,567 --> 00:20:00,567
There, hopefully you won't drop
it again next time.

293
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:04,267
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

294
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:21,100
Don't worry,
no one will see us here.

295
00:20:21,233 --> 00:20:23,800
I just want to busk here.

296
00:20:23,933 --> 00:20:25,433
I'm just being careful.

297
00:20:25,567 --> 00:20:27,867
Someone might ask
for a photo with you.

298
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:29,567
If your dad finds out,

299
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:31,400
who's also the very strict
manager of our band,

300
00:20:31,533 --> 00:20:33,767
that you're here,
we're in trouble.

301
00:20:35,267 --> 00:20:37,267
I'm just hoping, Jacob.

302
00:20:39,233 --> 00:20:40,933
That Angel might be here
at Manila Park

303
00:20:41,067 --> 00:20:42,867
since this is where
you met before?

304
00:20:44,733 --> 00:20:46,533
What if she comes back, right?

305
00:20:47,767 --> 00:20:48,867
[JACOB CLICKS TONGUE]

306
00:20:53,833 --> 00:20:57,300
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

307
00:20:57,433 --> 00:20:58,733
Crap, it's Dad.

308
00:20:59,833 --> 00:21:02,533
[GRIPPING MUSIC PLAYING]

309
00:21:02,667 --> 00:21:03,867
Miguel.

310
00:21:06,333 --> 00:21:07,300
Miguel!

311
00:21:10,467 --> 00:21:11,700
Miguel,

312
00:21:11,833 --> 00:21:13,567
what are you doing here

313
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:16,367
wearing that stupid costume?

314
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:21,100
[GRIPPING MUSIC INTENSIFIES]

315
00:21:21,233 --> 00:21:24,833
<i>Find out tomorrow
on You're My Favorite Song...</i>

316
00:21:24,967 --> 00:21:26,333
This is our row for today.

317
00:21:26,467 --> 00:21:28,200
Oh, did you hear that?

318
00:21:28,333 --> 00:21:30,200
- You heard that, right?
- You should know,

319
00:21:30,333 --> 00:21:31,533
aside from Calix,

320
00:21:33,133 --> 00:21:37,167
<i>she's someone you shouldn't
mess with.</i>

321
00:21:37,533 --> 00:21:39,167
What do you mean?

322
00:21:42,433 --> 00:21:44,367
<i> I just thought about Serina.</i>

323
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:48,267
<i>Her anger toward us is intense.</i>

324
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:51,133
<i>Do you want me to talk to her,
Dad?</i>

325
00:21:51,267 --> 00:21:54,700
I'll tell her about your cancer.

326
00:21:55,633 --> 00:21:56,867
Here's the payment.

327
00:21:57,000 --> 00:22:00,600
I'll add more, just make sure
you do your job well.

328
00:22:00,733 --> 00:22:01,733
Yes.

329
00:22:01,867 --> 00:22:03,700
Leave it to us, Miss Serina.

330
00:22:03,833 --> 00:22:05,867
Their grand opening
will not happen.

331
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,567
All right, leave now.

332
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:12,233
Are you seriously
saying that to my face?

333
00:22:12,367 --> 00:22:14,267
I'm your wife now

334
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:16,700
and Celestine is presumed dead.

335
00:22:16,867 --> 00:22:19,033
You're just wasting your time.

336
00:22:20,233 --> 00:22:22,000
If anything happens to him,

337
00:22:22,133 --> 00:22:23,933
all his wealth will go to you.

338
00:22:26,433 --> 00:22:29,600
Are you suggesting
we kill Enrico?

339
00:22:34,367 --> 00:22:36,433
I'm not afraid of you, Calix.

340
00:22:37,533 --> 00:22:38,567
Do it, Calix.

341
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:39,600
Punch her.

342
00:22:39,733 --> 00:22:41,233
Yeah, she deserves it.

343
00:22:41,367 --> 00:22:42,767
Bro, Bro.

344
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:48,500
Hey, my bag!

345
00:22:48,667 --> 00:22:51,133
["YOU'RE MY FAVORITE SONG"
BY PRINCESS ALIYAH]

346
00:22:51,267 --> 00:22:53,033
Wait, this bag...

347
00:22:53,167 --> 00:22:54,700
I know this bag.

348
00:22:54,833 --> 00:22:55,733
There.

349
00:22:55,867 --> 00:22:57,100
If it's okay with you,

350
00:22:57,233 --> 00:22:58,533
I can lift you up.

351
00:22:58,667 --> 00:23:00,033
You seem familiar.

352
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:06,967
Yup, it's me, Angel.

353
00:23:07,100 --> 00:23:08,233
[CHUCKLES]

354
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:16,367
- [CLAPPING]
- We were amazing.

355
00:23:18,500 --> 00:23:20,133
Come on, smile,
we're in the lead.

356
00:23:20,267 --> 00:23:26,733
♪ 'Cause baby,
you are my favorite song ♪
